            <div xml:id="d1273">

                <pb facs="1081" n="977" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg977"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.1215/476.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-06-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 13, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>286. Department’s 244 of June 13. I had already made acknowledgment of the note,
                    practically in the sense of the Department’s instruction. But for fear of any
                    omission I have just sent an additional note.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry Lane Wilson</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
